  "body": "## What's Changed\n* fix(discover): clamp mDNS hostname to 63-byte DNS labels by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/195\n* fix: server, tui, and transport reliability improvements post-#195 by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/196\n* fix(tui): correct throughput reporting, sparkline bounds, and connection logging by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/197\n* fix(tui): mark heavy loss without inverting the bar by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/200\n* feat(quic): implement bitrate pacing for QUIC transport (LAN-1497) by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/198\n* fix(tui): quiet the title, block-glyph progress bar, and 80-column footer by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/201\n* docs: correct claims invalidated by the QUIC pacing and TUI work by @lance0 in https://github.com/lance0/xfr/pull/202\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lance0/xfr/compare/v0.10.0...v0.10.1",
